"`Gateway -> diagnostic -> orb project -> nine laboratories -> red/blue "
"mission -> Vigil report -> professor decision -> portfolio`"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/alpha-architecture.md:7
#: 77982323e7de46b9a90ae1a3d9a1ed89
msgid ""
"The Gateway owns the credential-blind session contract. FfeD-QLC stores "
"pseudonymous local learning state in SQLite and immutable generated evidence"
" in a SHA-256-addressed artifact store. A real session cannot start when the"
" Gateway contract is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"The Gateway owns the credential-blind session contract. FfeD-QLC stores "
"pseudonymous local learning state in SQLite and immutable generated evidence"
" in a SHA-256-addressed artifact store. A real session cannot start when the"
" Gateway contract is unavailable."

